comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-28T12:09:34.208Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all-status PM text for CodeFactor static quality shallow checkout, origin main merge base, nightly checkout, and fetch depth. No existing item owns this checkout-topology defect; pm-92if is the canonical parent and pm-ihmfs6 is the discovery run."
  "2026-07-28T12:14:58.057Z","harness:codex","Nightly run 30356894804 reproduced the defect on Ubuntu Node 24: CodeFactor parity could not resolve origin/default in the one-commit checkout. The workflow now fetches full history; the unchanged fail-closed unit contract remains covered by 66 static-gate tests."
